  <item nodeId="node-267">
    <command xml:space="preserve">pull lever</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">With a wrenching pull, the brake lever slams down. The wheels scream, the train screeches to a halt. The artifact hums in your arms-the heist is complete.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;    *** You've stopped the train. Now all that remains is the escape-and the world you've left behind. ***&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;Would you like to RESTART, RESTORE a saved game, QUIT or UNDO the last command?&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-181">
    <command xml:space="preserve">north</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Passenger Car&#x000A;Rows of torn seats, luggage spilling everywhere. Sparks flicker overhead. The Dining Car is forward.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-182"/>
    </children>
  </item>
