    <result xml:space="preserve">In the broken panel is a piece of metal.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;    *** The train derails in a blaze of steel and fire, taking you and the artifact with it. ***&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;Would you like to RESTART, RESTORE a saved game, QUIT or UNDO the last command?&#x000A;&gt;</result>
