  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-221">
    <command xml:space="preserve">north</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Locomotive&#x000A;Steel walls, gauges shattered, levers jammed. The engineer lies slumped, gone. The only hope is to somehow stop the train.&#x000A;&#x000A;A maintenance panel hangs open, exposing sparking wires and a nest of gears.&#x000A;&#x000A;You can also see a brake lever here.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-222"/>
    </children>
  </item>
